abstract: >-
  Code, the selected index lists and the per-run accuracy table behind the
  paper on selecting fine-tuning data by the predictive entropy a teacher
  model carries at gated positions. Includes the two-ended contrast that is
  the paper's main test, the disagreement-rate measurement, the
  published-criterion baselines, and a verification script that recomputes
  the paper's headline numbers from the released table alone.
keywords:
  - data selection
  - knowledge distillation
  - language models
  - predictive entropy
